  "steps": [
    {"text": "Heat the oven to 200 °C."},
    {"text": "Toss the potatoes and leeks with half the oil and a little salt in a large tray."},
    {"text": "Rub the chicken with the rest of the oil, the paprika, lemon zest and salt, and lay it skin up on the vegetables."},
    {"text": "Roast for 40 minutes until the skin is crisp, then squeeze over the lemon juice."}
